		{"id":"0ced664328eff1da","x":-440,"y":-500,"width":311,"height":200,"type":"text","text":"# Player Headset / VR Glasses\n- Raspberry Pi 4 or 5\n- Displays simple 2D bird's-eye graphics\n- Receives OSC / UDP over dedicated 5 GHz Wi-Fi"},
